ate Layout ####**First Floor**#{1}":[57,57],"#Locations - Claymore Manor - Layout##Claymore Manor - Estate Layout ####**First Floor**#{2}":[58,60],"#Locations - Claymore Manor - Layout##Claymore Manor - Estate Layout ####**First Floor**#{3}":[61,68],"#Locations - Claymore Manor - Layout##Claymore Manor - Estate Layout ####**First Floor**#{4}":[69,72],"#Locations - Claymore Manor - Layout##Claymore Manor - Estate Layout ####**First Floor**#{5}":[73,73],"#Locations - Claymore Manor - Layout##Claymore Manor - Estate Layout ####**Second Floor**":[74,79],"#Locations - Claymore Manor - Layout##Claymore Manor - Estate Layout ####**Second Floor**#{1}":[75,75],"#Locations - Claymore Manor - Layout##Claymore Manor - Estate Layout ####**Second Floor**#{2}":[76,79]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":100,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["claymore manor","manor","halls","room","staircase","ground floor","first floor","second floor","east wing","west wing","baths"],"position":"before","cascade_links":["Claymore Manor"],"depth":4,"scanDepth":1,"summary":"**Claymore Manor is an estate divided into three floors. The **Ground Floor** includes the public Great Hall, East Wing administrative rooms, West Wing kitchens and servants' commons, and North Wing utilities. The **First Floor** houses the family's East Wing quarters (Charlotte, Florence, {{user}}), a large mistresses' bath, and West Wing guest/senior staff suites. The **Second Floor** contains junior staff dormitories and an observatory (astronomy room), with additional storage and attics.\n\n**Select this entry** when {{user}} moves between floors, seeks a specific room for conversation/action, or when location determines social hierarchy (e.g., visiting servants' commons vs. family quarters).\n\n**Key relationships:** Charlotte (mistress), Florence (her daughter), Mrs. Marie (kitchen, West Wing), Henry (butler). {{user}} is welcome in the servants' commons."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_